  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "# Changes since version 9.2.0:\n\n## Added\n- A CycloneDX software bill of materials (SBOM) is now included in the NuGet package, with a separate SBOM for each target framework. (DOC-7727)\n\n## Fixed\n- Fixed an issue where footnote numbering started at `FootnoteOptions.StartingNumber` instead of 1 when `FootnoteOptions.NumberingRule` was set to `RestartPage`; footnote marks and NOTEREF results now match Microsoft Word. (DOC-7775, DOC-7914)\n- Fixed a `StackOverflowException` that terminated the process when a document contained a cycle of `w:basedOn` style references. (DOC-7795)\n- Fixed an issue where loading a document failed if a measurement attribute used a unit suffix (for example, `1in` or `2.54cm`) instead of twips. (DOC-7796)\n- Fixed an issue where unit-suffixed measurements (for example, an `18pt` font size) were silently discarded when loading a document, and default values were used instead. (DOC-7797)\n- Fixed an issue where loading a document failed if its font table contained duplicate font entries. (DOC-7798)\n- Fixed an issue where loading a document failed if the names or aliases of two styles differed only by case or collided with each other. (DOC-7799)",
